{"id":401001701,"chapter_id":50025,"scene_id":52511,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"罗睺不喜欢但持续了一天的战斗，以及与狂厄污染的深度接触终于在夜最深时短暂夺取了她的意识。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"content":"她再一次梦见了过去。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"冷静的声音","content":"从内海回来的就她一个？最后的幸存者，令人敬佩。","voice":["vo_event_401001701_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":10006002,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"？？","content":"……上庭的……长官？","voice":["vo_event_401001701_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":10006002,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"？？","content":"任务……失败了……防线，还有，城里的人……都怎么样了……","voice":["vo_event_401001701_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":10006002,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"冷静的声音","content":"不算失败。城邦很安全，不用担心。","voice":["vo_event_401001701_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":10006002,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"冷静的声音","content":"前线的事你还记得多少？记得自己怎么离开的吗？","voice":["vo_event_401001701_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":10006002,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"？？","content":"记得的事……我记得……还有人没撤离，很多人留在那里……","voice":["vo_event_401001701_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":10006002,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"？？","content":"……回去救他们……拜托，求你们……别留她在那里……","voice":["vo_event_401001701_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":10006002,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"冷静的声音","content":"太晚了。内海已经涨潮，作战区域被彻底吞没。现在进入，任何防护都撑不过体感3小时。","voice":["vo_event_401001701_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":10006002,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"speaker":"？？","content":"……彻底吞没……？","voice":["vo_event_401001701_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":10006002,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"speaker":"冷静的声音","content":"放心。上庭不会忘记你们，所有战士都会得到英雄勋章。","voice":["vo_event_401001701_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":10006002,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"content":"她的呼吸急促起来。","style":3,"background":10006002,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"speaker":"？？","content":"你们算过……你们知道内海会涨潮……知道那里会被淹没……","voice":["vo_event_401001701_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":10006002,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"？？","content":"你们早就知道会是这种结果……","voice":["vo_event_401001701_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":10006002,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"speaker":"？？","content":"那为什么要我们去！！！！","voice":["vo_event_401001701_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":10006002,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"content":"她咆哮着扑向那个面目模糊的上庭代表，好几只手伸向她试图阻拦，女人咆哮着向前撕扯。","style":3,"background":4146001,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"speaker":"？？","content":"时间根本不够，进去就是送死，你们明明知道，为什么没预警？！为什么要隐瞒？！那么多人命你们根本不在乎吗？！","voice":["vo_event_401001701_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":4146001,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"speaker":"？？","content":"FAC相信你们的“计算”，信你们每个安排，毫不犹豫地执行指令。他们只想为城邦战斗，却是这么个结果？！他们死得毫无价值？！！","voice":["vo_event_401001701_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":4146001,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"speaker":"？？","content":"开什么玩笑？！！为什么下这种命令！","voice":["vo_event_401001701_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":4146001,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"speaker":"？？","content":"<size=40>是<color=#fb9259>谁</color>下的命令？！！</size>","voice":["vo_event_401001701_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":4146001,"log_type":1},{"step":23,"speaker":"冷静的声音","content":"……无所谓隐瞒，也没必要解释，探究和判断只会带来迷茫。FAC不需要这些。","voice":["vo_event_401001701_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":4146001,"log_type":1},{"step":24,"speaker":"冷静的声音","content":"你们已经实现了生命的价值，自会有人赞颂。","voice":["vo_event_401001701_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":4146001,"log_type":1},{"step":25,"speaker":"？？","content":"——我宰了你！！！！","voice":["vo_event_401001701_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":4146001,"log_type":1},{"step":27,"content":"最后的理智断了，她冲了上去，被一记重锤掀翻在地，随即被重重包围，被推搡着远离。","style":3,"background":4146001,"log_type":1},{"step":28,"speaker":"冷静的声音","content":"……没关系，战场带来的精神创伤罢了，FAC内部很常见。带去疗养吧，挺可怜的。","voice":["vo_event_401001701_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":4146001,"log_type":1},{"step":29,"speaker":"冷静的声音","content":"像家犬，失去主人也会心理失衡。","voice":["vo_event_401001701_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":4146001,"log_type":1},{"step":30,"speaker":"？？","content":"站住，别走——！！那个任务是谁发来的，05257885是谁？告诉我！","voice":["vo_event_401001701_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":4146001,"log_type":1},{"step":31,"speaker":"？？","content":"要我们去死的上庭人到底是<color=#fb9259>谁</color>？！","voice":["vo_event_401001701_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":4146001,"log_type":1},{"step":32,"voice":["vo_event_401001701_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":18,"background":4141,"log_type":1},{"step":34,"content":"手中的电话不断震动，罗睺醒了，却没有接。直到震动停止，未接来电上显示“FAC密电”字样。","style":3,"background":4141,"log_type":1},{"step":35,"content":"她起身戴上面罩，遮盖自己尚未平复的沉重喘息。","style":3,"background":4141,"log_type":1},{"step":36,"speaker":"罗睺","content":"……<color=#fb9259>丧主之犬</color>吗，好名字……","voice":["vo_event_401001701_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":37,"speaker":"罗睺","content":"我闻到气味了，就快了……马上来……等着……","voice":["vo_event_401001701_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":38,"speaker":"罗睺","content":"马上来咬断你们的脖子。","voice":["vo_event_401001701_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_10017","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1}]}